<title>USA: MultiMedia Access completes IPO.</title>
<headline>MultiMedia Access completes IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>MultiMedia Access Corp completed its initial public offering of 1.4 million shares of common stock and 1.4 million redeemable common stock purchase warrants, according to underwriter Network 1 Financial Securities Inc.</p>
<p>The shares were priced at $4.50 for each common share and $0.10 for each warrant and began trading on February 4.</p>
<p>The company makes videoconferencing systems for personal computers. Shares were flat at 4-7/8.</p>
